        "TileImage": "$($repository 9d4e194d-67e5-48a6-819e-172556f40157).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Your target is the director of the Himmapan Hotel in Bangkok. Behind the façade of luxury, he launders money through the hotel’s accounts and sells private guest information to criminal networks. His continued presence threatens ICA operations in the region. Infiltrate the property, locate the director, and eliminate him quietly. Maintain discretion, avoid civilian casualties, and exit without alert.",
